      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VOLTS (3) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (22.92) in a Special conditions Veteran race at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from five starts. Tough to beat if on-song. MUSTANG ELEANOR (8) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (23.08) at this track behind Little Miss May in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings eight times from 16 attempts. Leading chance. UNDERSHOT VALMA (2) finished third (23.15) two back at Ballarat but out of the placings last time when 6th there. Expected to give a good account. RUTH'S COMMANDER (1) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
